{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Float Your Goat</i></strong>, journey across the seas over hand designed puzzles while helping the goat and his \u201cfriends\u201d stay dry. Build increasingly elaborate rafts and test your problem solving skills with realistic buoyancy physics that can lead to the goats peril. Construct rafts using different materials with unique features to battle various environmental elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level can be completed in countless ways, have endless fun exploring multiple solutions and constructions for every step of the way. Unlock materials in each region and watch your rafts get more elaborate. Build them reliably and sturdily or risk it all with goofy solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.poster.avif?t=1772823659\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.webm?t=1772823659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/68f013c68587b50ec66b67dfe15063ea.mp4?t=1772823659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wacky rafts lead to wacky accidents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goat is by no means indestructible. He can be crushed, drowned, flung and whacked and so can his \u201ccompanions\u201d. Be sure to check how much trauma you\u2019ve caused at the end of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/5b3ecfd29dd5b0b7f3cfe98b23e0c410.poster.avif?t=1772823659\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/5b3ecfd29dd5b0b7f3cfe98b23e0c410.webm?t=1772823659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/5b3ecfd29dd5b0b7f3cfe98b23e0c410.mp4?t=1772823659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep a close eye on the weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One large wind gust can throw your whole raft off balance. Challenge yourself in each level to combat changes in the elements. Remember, the goat hates water in any form and one drop of rain will have him jumping into the sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/e7ee18af7776b01550bc06c87d843fb5.poster.avif?t=1772823659\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/e7ee18af7776b01550bc06c87d843fb5.webm?t=1772823659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/e7ee18af7776b01550bc06c87d843fb5.mp4?t=1772823659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across hand drawn environments with wildlife thats inspired by different locations across the world. Enjoy the sunshine of the tropics or the snow of the arctic as a beautiful backdrop to each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932600/extras/60b26e806b67e9f85892306c5e87b378.poster.avif?t=1772823659\" width=1170 height=65